##All 7 routes (5 courses + 2 completions)
#404 for a nonexistent course
#400 for invalid course POST
#400 for invalid completion PUT (violated prerequisite)
### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=WebStorm

###
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002/api

###GET all books 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

###GET one book by id 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1

###GET book does not exist 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/9999

###Search by title 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/search/the

###POST -create new book 201 (use this Id for lower steps too(Delete, etc.))
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Alchemist",
  "pages": 197,
  "author": "Coelho",
  "year": 1988,
  "num_sold": 150
}

###PUT update created boook above
###PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/BookID_tbd
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Alchemist",
  "pages": 197,
  "author": "Coelho",
  "year": 1988,
  "num_sold": 200
}

###DELETE remove created book
###DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/IDOfCreated Book

###Confirm deletion 404
###GET {{baseUrl}}/books/IDOF CREATed book

### POST missing required field -- expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Incomplete Book"
}

